                  },
                  {
                    "tab_title": "How and when do I get paid?",
                    "tab_content": "Payments are processed securely and sent directly to your bank account or local mobile money system (e.g. Bankak, SyberPay) on a weekly basis."
                  },
                  {
                    "tab_title": "Who handles shipping and deliveries?",
                    "tab_content": "We partner with local delivery services to handle pickups and shipping. Once you package an order, our delivery partner will collect it from your location."
                  },
                  {
                    "tab_title": "What kinds of products can I sell?",
